OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the men applying for the
OL,4,A'hardest job in British politics'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWanted: one leader for Scottish Labour.
OL,7,FMust enjoy long hours, complex
OL,8,Ftrade-offs and difficult questions.
OL,10,FThat may not be the official job
OL,11,Fdescription for Scottish Labour leader,
OL,12,Fbut it's perhaps not far from the
OL,13,Ftruth.
OL,15,FAfter all, Anas Sarwar described this
OL,16,Fgig as "the hardest job in British
OL,17,Fpolitics".
OL,19,FDespite this health warning, two
OL,20,Fcandidates are on the ballot paper
OL,21,Fvying to take on the challenge -
OL,22,FMichael Marra and Joe Fagan.
